Mappings: Documentation

Purpose:
  Maps human-readable docs to .sdd counterparts and defines
  documentation impact graph.

DocMapping:
  docs/business/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/docs/mappings.sdd
    audience: BUSINESS, MANAGER
    owner: BUSINESS
    depth: L1
    type: BUSINESS

  docs/architecture/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/architecture/INDEX.sdd
    audience: ARCHITECT, DEVELOPER
    owner: ARCHITECT
    depth: L2
    type: ARCHITECTURE

  docs/developer/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/docs/mappings.sdd
    audience: DEVELOPER, QA
    owner: DEVELOPER
    depth: L2
    type: GUIDE

  docs/testing/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/testing/INDEX.sdd
    audience: QA, DEVELOPER
    owner: QA
    depth: L2
    type: REFERENCE

  docs/security/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/security/INDEX.sdd
    audience: SECURITY, DEVELOPER, QA
    owner: SECURITY
    depth: L3
    type: REFERENCE

  docs/infrastructure/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/stack/infrastructure.sdd
    audience: DEVOPS, OPERATIONS
    owner: DEVOPS
    depth: L3
    type: REFERENCE

  docs/deployment/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/workflow/lifecycle.sdd
    audience: DEVOPS, OPERATIONS
    owner: DEVOPS
    depth: L2
    type: PROCEDURE

  docs/operations/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/observability/INDEX.sdd
    audience: OPERATIONS, DEVOPS, SUPPORT
    owner: DEVOPS
    depth: L3
    type: RUNBOOK

  docs/support/INDEX.md:
    sdd: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/docs/mappings.sdd
    audience: SUPPORT, OPERATIONS
    owner: SUPPORT
    depth: L1
    type: TROUBLESHOOT

  docs/incidents/INC-*.md:
    sdd: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/observability/incidents/
    audience: OPERATIONS, DEVOPS, SECURITY
    owner: DEVOPS
    depth: L3
    type: POSTMORTEM

  docs/decisions/DEC-*.md:
    sdd: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/decisions/
    audience: ARCHITECT, DEVELOPER, MANAGER
    owner: ARCHITECT
    depth: L2
    type: DECISION

  docs/runbooks/RB-*.md:
    sdd: .sdd/observability/alerting.sdd
    audience: OPERATIONS, DEVOPS, SUPPORT
    owner: DEVOPS
    depth: L2
    type: RUNBOOK

ImpactGraph:
  repository.go:
    ?
  repository.sdd
    ?
  analytics domain
    ?
  docs/developer/analytics.md
    ?
  docs/architecture/data-flow.md

DocumentationStatus:
  CURRENT
  STALE
  REVIEW
  DRAFT
  ARCHIVED

State: +
  